{"id":606,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主自律と対話で磨く六年一貫教育","feature_description":"鈴鹿中等教育学校は、建学の精神「誠実で信頼される人に」を基盤に、主体的な学びと自主・自律の校風づくりを進める六年一貫校です。授業では生徒同士の対話を取り入れ、多様な考えを受け止めて表現する力を育てます。大学入試に向けた学力だけでなく、創造力や発想力、キャリア教育、探究、国際交流も重視し、自己実現に向けて学びを深める姿勢を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":11486,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11487,"name":"陸上競技部（後期課程）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11488,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11489,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11490,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11491,"name":"女子硬式テニス部（前期課程）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11492,"name":"男子硬式テニス部（前期課程）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11493,"name":"男女共通硬式テニス部（後期課程）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11494,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11495,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11496,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11497,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11498,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://suzukakyoei.ed.jp/suzuka6/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-1